<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TIB lifts final dividend.</title>
<headline>TIB lifts final dividend.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Technical and Industrial Investments Ltd  TIB.J on Thursday declared a final dividend of 32.69 cts versus 26.14 cts, bringing the total for the year to March 31, 1997 to 52.94 cts against 43.02 cts a year ago.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the final dividend would be paid to shareholders registered on February 21 and paid out no later than February 28.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town newsroom +27 21 25-2238</p>
</text>
